    "tree_id": "594bc94bad84aa420d0410c3b70633a33b19dfc8",
    "message": "bound slow-client writes with WriteTimeout, keep SSE alive\n\nWriteTimeout was 0, so a slow/stalled client could pin a connection\nindefinitely. Set a 5-minute server-wide write deadline as the backstop;\nthe SSE run-events stream renews its own write deadline via\nResponseController on every replay flush and heartbeat (12s interval,\ndeadline 2x), so long-lived event streams are unaffected while every\nother route gets the bounded timeout.",
    "timestamp": "2026-09-03T09:21:50Z",
